+// Browser E2E for the BROWSER EDITION (web-demo/dist/ultra-link.html): the single self-contained page published as a
+// claude.ai Artifact. No server: every /api/* call is answered in the page (web-demo/local-api.ts) and the state lives
+// in this browser's localStorage + IndexedDB. Opened from file:// in Chromium at 390×844 (touch) and 1280×800.
+//
+// Scenarios per viewport (fresh browser context = empty storage):
+//   0. an older edition's data (ultra-link-demo-v1) is dropped with a note in the banner; the banner lists what is simulated
+//   1. log in as a persona → «بدي شقة للإيجار بإعزاز حد أقصى 200 دولار» → «بالشهر» → results with reasons
+//   2. «طلب تواصل» → auto-accepted (synthetic persona) → «فتح المحادثة» → send → a LABELLED automatic demo reply;
+//      «شارك رقمي» toggle → the persona's obviously fake number; live location share shows «غير متاح في نسخة المتصفح»
+//   3. «بدي تكسي قريب مني» → «استخدم موقعي الحالي» → the app's own Arabic permission error → type «إعزاز» → rides with distances
+//   4. «متجري» as the demo store's owner: bulk import 3 lines → preview → confirm → listed (25 → 28); a photo with EXIF/GPS
+//      is re-encoded (no metadata left) and shown
+//   5. the demo buyer sees a store badge («من أبو أحمد للموبايلات (تجريبي)») on a match
+//   6. register a local account → recovery code shown once → logout → recover with the code
+//   7. reload keeps the data; «إعادة ضبط البيانات» resets it
+// Always: no console errors / page errors / failed requests, no unimplemented /api/* endpoint (the page logs every one),
+// no horizontal overflow. Screenshots: test/e2e/artifacts/web-demo/.
+//
+// Run: node web-demo/build.ts && node test/e2e/web-demo.spec.ts   (CHROMIUM_PATH overrides /opt/pw-browsers/chromium)
+
